    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_usd0015ed8](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_usd0015ed8) Magnitude 5.4 earthquake at 10.0 depth occurred on Aug 17 2026 76km N of Ruteng. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude -7.9289 longitude 120.4324. It impacted 88030 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
